#
# The per-VM half of the egress gateway's environment (/etc/mediatore-gateway/vm.env):
# the fixed address on the sandbox segment, one per gateway, the three the pool lists in
# /etc/mediatore/gateways and the broker in `gateways`. Delivered as the VirtualMachine's
# userData (deploy/gateway/virtualmachines.yaml), since the image and its layers are the
# same for all three (banlieue ADR-0109 decision 6).
SANDBOX_ADDRESS=198.51.100.1
